# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Allowlist .gitignore — you live INSIDE this clone.
#
# Everything at the root is ignored by default; only the OSS-shipped files
# below are un-ignored (tracked) — including cookbook/, the sample shelf that
# holds the hand-redacted excerpts of the author's live loop, added file by
# file on purpose (see cookbook/README.md). The old roots evidence/ and
# community/ stay un-ignored too, but they now hold only compat stubs
# pointing at the shelf — the artifacts themselves are under cookbook/author/
# and cookbook/community/. So the instance data setup.sh scaffolds
# next to them — ssot/, judgment/, projects/, briefs/, logs/, local/
# (machine-local scripts & secrets), system_map.md, approval_queue.md,
# verifiers.md, config.env, CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md — can never be committed,
# by construction. `git pull` updates the kit under you without touching
# your data.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ignore everything at the root...
/*

# ...except the kit itself
!/.github
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/README_ja.md
!/community
!/config.env.example
!/cookbook
!/docs
!/evidence
!/images
!/manifests
!/scripts
!/templates
!/tests

# ...and the norms shelf's SHAPE — its README and the empty .example — while the
# entries themselves stay instance data. ssot/ is un-ignored only as far as
# those two exact files: ssot/norms/writing.md and any ssot/norms/*.md you add
# are still uncommittable, like the rest of ssot/. The order matters — a parent
# directory has to be un-excluded before a file inside it can be re-included —
# and the width of the hole is asserted by test groups D and H, not promised
# here. See ssot/norms/README.md and docs/norms-loop.md.
!/ssot
/ssot/*
!/ssot/norms
/ssot/norms/*
!/ssot/norms/README.md
!/ssot/norms/writing.md.example

# inside the tracked dirs: your live weekly distiller (holds your paths/CONFIG)
scripts/weekly_distill.sh
# ...and your live inbound watcher (same pattern: the .example is the kit)
scripts/inbound_watch.sh

# Python / OS / editor cruft (applies inside tracked dirs too)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
